The neural voice back end in this directory (eva_nn.c, eva_nn.h, eva_voice.c,
eva_voice.h, eva_crf.c, eva_crf.h) is MIT-licensed code from the OneCore engine
that Sapple vendors (Quinton1110/Sapple, Engine/onecore, originally
ms-david-zira-decomp), reconstructed from Microsoft's MSTTSEngine_OneCore.dll.

